      "x": -300,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 260,
      "text": "Mobile backbone\n\nTop: level · goal status · credits (the HUD).\nBottom: 学習 Learn · 実践 Practice · 本日 Today · 辞書 Dictionary · 定期券 Profile.\n\nRow 1: the Today tab and a run, then the Learn tab down to a platform list, then Practice.\nRow 2: Dictionary and the analyzer behind it, the Profile in two scrolls, and the two sheets the HUD opens.\n\nEvery artboard has a dark / light tweak."
    },
    {
      "id": "credits",
      "page": "screens",
      "x": -300,
      "y": 984,
      "w": 260,
      "text": "Balance system, as drawn\n\n1 credit = 1 review. Free: +30 a day at 00:00, holds up to 50. Subscription: 定期券, unlimited.\n\nThe gate prices the run (運賃) against the balance (残高) before departure; a run longer than the balance stops at the balance and says so.\n\nAssumed: practice, the dictionary and the analyzer do not spend credits."
    },
